# Flutter rewrites these platform plugin registrants with LF endings on every
# `flutter pub get` / build. Git for Windows ships with core.autocrlf=true, which
# then wants to convert them to CRLF — so they show up as "modified" after every
# build even though not a single character of content changed.
#
# Pinning them to LF makes the working copy match exactly what Flutter writes,
# so they stay clean. These files are generated, never hand-edited, so there is
# no reason for them to differ per platform.
#
# Scoped deliberately to the generated files only: a repo-wide `* text=auto`
# would renormalize the whole tree and hand every teammate a huge one-off diff.
**/generated_plugin_registrant.*  text eol=lf
**/generated_plugins.cmake        text eol=lf
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*    text eol=lf
